# Variant c — the frontier model alone, one effort rung above variant a, for every untagged
# (mid) step. Asks whether `medium` removes the did-not-check-its-own-work findings that
# separated a from b (stale CLAUDE.md line, missing bump, a test that does not test its name,
# a false CHANGELOG sentence) for less than b's advisor costs.
# Run steps 1 and 2 only (`--to 2`). Tagged steps keep their tier, so letting it run on would
# still be comparable with a and b.
# Protocol, results and follow-ups: docs/plans/plan-runner-benchmark.md
MODEL_MID=fable
EFFORT_MID=medium
ADVISOR_MID=
JUDGE_MODEL=opus
JUDGE_EFFORT=high
